WEBVTT

00:11:29.633 --> 00:11:33.674
But then came along
these master storytellers --

00:11:33.698 --> 00:11:35.182
the big bankers,

00:11:35.206 --> 00:11:36.646
the finance ministers,

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.024
the prime ministers --

00:11:38.048 --> 00:11:40.526
and they tell us a very convincing story:

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.508
"Look, you see this green piece of paper?

00:11:42.532 --> 00:11:45.115
It is actually worth 10 bananas."

00:11:45.591 --> 00:11:47.700
And if I believe it, and you believe it,

00:11:47.724 --> 00:11:49.240
and everybody believes it,

00:11:49.264 --> 00:11:51.128
it actually works.

00:11:51.152 --> 00:11:54.065
I can take this worthless piece of paper,

00:11:54.089 --> 00:11:55.726
go to the supermarket,

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:59.757
give it to a complete stranger
whom I've never met before,

00:11:59.781 --> 00:12:04.466
and get, in exchange, real bananas
which I can actually eat.